				"string" : "### Current execution evidence and acceptance limits for blocked prototype sprint\nSuperGame.image / Pharo13.1.0SNAPSHOT, current examplesInClassesRun: 84 successes, 0 failures, 0 errors, 0 skips, no missing classes. Classes: CFConfigurationExamples, CFAtelierEntryExamples, CFConfigurationEditorElementExamples, CRConfigurationExamples, CRRuntimeConfigurationExamples, CRRuntimeConfigurationValidatorExamples, CRRuntimeConfigurationCodecExamples, CRRuntimeConfigurationNodeExamples, CRFailureEvidenceConfigurationExamples, CRSnapshotIsolationExamples. This includes current projection/staged-root/Atelier library preview Motion cancellation/rejection examples, legacy animation-origin/traversal checks and Runtime snapshot cycle/isolation examples. These are unchanged-hierarchy baseline results, not new-model acceptance. Runner detail and returned objects remain in this linked child chat. Representative results: {{gtObject:id=82hpew2f9jukzxqfty9x34rsq|fallbackLabelString='Current staged-root Motion preview example'}}, {{gtObject:id=1stpreli285li8lfdfklmjund|fallbackLabelString='Current snapshot extension-slot and parent-cycle example'}}.\n\nNo focused examples were added; new hierarchy, default-override dispatch, nearest/no-match ancestry, accessor override and instance parent-value migration acceptance remain unverified. No full Motion/Atelier/SUnit suite, live busy rendering, interactive usability, network/model acceptance, remote GemStone or production mutation. One read-only diagnostic evaluation sent nonexistent GtLChat>>title and raised MessageNotUnderstood; preserved as {{gtObject:id=datk7rd82hzvr9fe1ji1kwzof|fallbackLabelString='Retained diagnostic exception'}}. It was not a test-runner failure and caused no source edit, rollback or replay.\n\nAcceptance: checkpoint/exact-owner reconciliation MET; requested prototype rename/new target/direct inheritance/one inherited parent/no duplicate behavior FAILED (not implemented); deliberate consumer migration and bounded remaining prototype consumers FAILED; required production class-switch removal FAILED; generic behavior allocation/focused examples FAILED as implementation; current existing selected GT checks MET as baseline only; new-model defaults/search/validation/snapshot and parent-value preservation UNVERIFIED. Existing authoring paths retained untouched; no staged relation redesign or Runtime activation. Publication: no source save/export/stage/commit/push/build/external checkout. Only maintained Lepiter contract notes were added. Next action: provide an existing supported class-rename tool in the authorized role; no new tool or infrastructure was implemented."
			}
